        <td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
<h1 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 24px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 20px;">Registration for our adult doubles tennis league closes on May 8.</h1>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Adult Doubles Tennis League season begins on May 31. Teams can choose to play on Tuesday, Wednesday or Thursday, with all matches being played at Woodward Park starting at 6 p.m.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">If you are searching for a teammate, <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfweColvlJzsLS7tRBNYJbnI7BtE3mIyknIT_rbYe5oVoWcxQ/viewform?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #003A69;">please fill out this form</a>. </p>
<table class="govd_button" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding-bottom: 15px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; margin: 0 auto;" align="center"><tbody><tr><td class="govd_button" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; background-color: #E41B2B; border-radius: 5px; text-align: center; display: inline-block; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; padding: 10px; border: none;" align="center" bgcolor="#E41B2B"><a href="https://columbusrecparks.com/wellness/athletics/tennis/adult/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-decoration: none !important;"><strong style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none;">Learn More</strong></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>
