<h1 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 24px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 20px;">Columbus Recreation and Parks is expanding its adult doubles tennis league offerings this year.</h1>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Adult Doubles Tennis League season begins on May 31 and registration opens on April 7 at 10 a.m.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Teams can choose to play on Tuesday, Wednesday or Thursday, with all matches being played at Woodward Park starting at 6 p.m.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">If you are searching for a teammate, <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfweColvlJzsLS7tRBNYJbnI7BtE3mIyknIT_rbYe5oVoWcxQ/viewform?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #003A69;">please fill out this form</a>. </p>
